#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "498884"
msgid "Who was the survivor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499204"
msgid "For #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's excessively human wish was granted:\nto sever its connection with Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499340"
msgid "\nRest well―――The sound of eyelids shutting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499408"
msgid "Rest well―――The sound of light fading."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499976"
msgid "It rapidly rouses \"me.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500096"
msgid "Ahh―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500172"
msgid "―――I'm alive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501032"
msgid "Who was the survivor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501372"
msgid "For #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's excessively human wish was granted:\nto sever its connection with Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501508"
msgid "\nRest well―――The sound of eyelids shutting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501576"
msgid "Rest well―――The sound of light fading."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "502404"
msgid "I was told that I was cryopreserved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "502576"
msgid "\nNow that I'm awake, that must mean that a\nvaccine has been developed.\nI woke up to a future that I could never even dream of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "503188"
msgid "But――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "503204"
msgid "The world changed a lot in these 30 years."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "503248"
msgid "The country I lived in isn't around anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "504016"
msgid "The world wobbles precariously between whether\nto embrace a society of ideals or a society of competition."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "504568"
msgid "Sheesh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "504692"
msgid "…yep.\nBut, I'm tired.\nI think I've done well so far, but I'm a little tired."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "505468"
msgid "…ahh, I'm a mess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "505936"
msgid "Something soundless rouses my consciousness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "506152"
msgid "Word is you're famous.\nThe elders gave me firm orders to make\na proper magus out of you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "506428"
msgid "\nHe extends an unfamiliar, rough hand to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "506512"
msgid "An unfamiliar sense of nostalgia washes over me,\nblurring my sight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "506692"
msgid "…\nSorry, but have we ever met before?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "506736"
msgid "I must've had a really weird look on my face.\nThe young man looks at me, puzzled.\nI reply, \"no, it's nothing.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "506884"
msgid "I don't know why, but I think I was gently smiling at him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507416"
msgid "#C080080080Used things, stolen things, forgotten things.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507696"
msgid "#C080080080…however, I'm still alive.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507848"
msgid "#C080080080So―――One journey may have ended,\nbut MY journey has yet to end.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507944"
msgid "#C080080080One battle ends, a new battle begins.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "508008"
msgid "#C080080080My disappointing break ends before I know it.\n#RUBS      The present#RUBENow#REND is my time to fight.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "509320"
msgid "Who was the survivor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "509640"
msgid "For #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's excessively human wish was granted:\nto sever its connection with Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "509776"
msgid "\nRest well―――The sound of eyelids shutting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "509844"
msgid "Rest well―――The sound of light fading."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510264"
msgid "It's the ending I'VE BEEN WAITING FOR!\nPraise be, praise beeee!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510328"
msgid "Lauded, blessed by Uka-no-Mitama-no-Kami!\nScrambling hyperspeed out the Yellow Emperor's\nMausoleum, racing across 1,000 light-years!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "510928"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF#C080080080 went looking for trouble by disregarding\nthis timeline, causality, coherency―everything.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511084"
msgid "I apologize for the wait! It took me quite\nsome time to get here, but I'm here now to\npick you up, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511440"
msgid "Here you go, Darling!\nPlease eat up鷙\nSay \"ahhh,\" \"ahhh\"鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511696"
msgid "…yeah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "511708"
msgid "I'm aware of how embarrassing a sight this is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512096"
msgid "…indeed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512332"
msgid "Huh?\nYou want to know how I reached you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "512708"
msgid "…so it does."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513172"
msgid "Meanwhile, #C236196003Caster#CDEF and I are treated as legends:\nthe ones who released the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513292"
msgid "It's all a big misunderstanding,\nso we decided to move away from the\n#C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF's center and live in this backcountry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "513432"
msgid "We only just moved in, but the lifestyle agrees with us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514056"
msgid "Likewise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514288"
msgid "\n―――I felt so happy that I closed my eyes,\nbut this time, there was nothing missing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514388"
msgid "The legend of the Moon may have ended,\nbut our legend continues."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514456"
msgid "Reflecting on that, I slowly open my eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514868"
msgid "A moment ago, the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF was\nhacked by an unknown party."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "514964"
msgid "Presently, normal operating areas have shrunk by\n3%. The capital has been overwritten with a 2D\ndot. To all in the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF, please evacuate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "515292"
msgid "Outside our apartment, everything is turning\ninto flatland and FAST…!\nIf this news report is true, was the #ROFS-008#C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF…\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF corrupted by someone again!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "515804"
msgid "Gah―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "515900"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF.\nWhy did the name \"#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF\" come up just now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "515992"
msgid "……………teehee?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516252"
msgid "Hahahahahahahahahahahahahaha! From morning to\nafternoon! Ladies and gentlemen of the\n#C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF―hear me and tremble!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516388"
msgid "The #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF is hereby our plaything!\nTo be more specific, we have formally split\nit into nine equal, independent nations!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517020"
msgid "One, two,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517052"
msgid "Ulp… The fox is out of the bag…\nEver the keen detective, Darling…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517444"
msgid "No―――don't tell me―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517472"
msgid "No, even #C236196003Caster#CDEF wouldn't do something so terrible.\nShe's a responsible woman.\nA proper adult that can tame the darkness in her\nheart… right!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517916"
msgid "She's worse than #C236196003BB#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518016"
msgid "You numbskull! You absolute dimwit!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518068"
msgid "And look, they're just palette swaps!\nThat's plain, flat-out lazy!\nThe #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF got taken over by THEM!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518360"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF starts to bawl.\nMaybe she's feeling responsible now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518508"
msgid "Ultimately, I'm the reason this all happened.\nThe #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF's populace may blame #C236196003Caster#CDEF,\nbut #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF is the one person who can't."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518820"
msgid "That's why I need to clean up this mess myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518944"
msgid "I begrudgingly reply, \"guess I have to.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519092"
msgid "Kya☆\nThis is why I LOVE my Darling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519380"
msgid "…however."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519800"
msgid "Hey, Darling?\nYou don't hate me?\nDespite everything that happened?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519872"
msgid "Huh? You're \"used to it\"?\nYou say we're fighting for my sake this time?\nAnd you want a new outfit?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521280"
msgid "Who was the survivor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521600"
msgid "For #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's excessively human wish was granted:\nto sever its connection with Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521736"
msgid "\nRest well―――The sound of eyelids shutting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521804"
msgid "Rest well―――The sound of light fading."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522448"
msgid "#C080080080Obeying this voice, I open my calcified eyelids.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523340"
msgid "And yet.\nAnd. Yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523456"
msgid "Wait, first I want an explanation…!\nWhere are we, what happened!?\nAnd why are you half-naked, man!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523700"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF cannot allow you to be.\nThus, it must get rid of you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524264"
msgid "Don't \"lo\" me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524352"
msgid "Please, contain your glee. You'll make me blush.\nWould you have preferred the alternative?\nTo quietly return to nothingness?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524588"
msgid "Still―――I feel like I'm being too greedy―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525000"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF holds both his arms out\ntowards the city below―a sprawling, unknown world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526040"
msgid "I place my hand in his."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526328"
msgid "\nI'm about to go on a journey with this\nextraordinary Heroic Spirit. It starts now."
msgstr ""

