#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582584"
msgid "\n\n        …and so, the battles came to an end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582632"
msgid "Whoever it was that desired war across Earth is gone now.\nAnd just like him,\nit was all thanks to this nobody of a young #[man][woman]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582772"
msgid "\nWhat was awarded to the victor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582808"
msgid "Was that almighty wish-granting device, in truth,\ncapable of granting wishes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582888"
msgid "…the person who knows those answers, now,\nis silently crumbling away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582960"
msgid "The #RUBSMoon Cell#RUBEdivine eye#REND changes the future\naccording to the #RUBS  wishes#RUBEdesires#REND of he who possesses it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583092"
msgid "And now that device no longer exists.\nThe way the #C000246204Moon Cell Automaton#CDEF functions\nwas transformed into something else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583228"
msgid "…please, take comfort.\nThe observation device is reverting into\nwhat it once was: a dreaming machine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583332"
msgid "\n―――Thus, everything came to an end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583372"
msgid "Bless this fool.\n           #[He][She]# was annihilated as the final\n           victor of the Moon's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583508"
msgid "\n\n\n                       ――Sincerely, the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core -\n                                    #RUBS    Angelica Cage  #RUBECage of Heaven's #RENDdevoted#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583684"
msgid "Suddenly,\nI'm awakened by a gentle sound."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583728"
msgid "…my suspended consciousness begins to relink.\n  My disconnected circuits begin to reconnect.\n  A great length of time passes.\n  Blood flows through the slumbering stone statue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583908"
msgid "A high temperature circulates throughout my body.\nIt's like something triggered and started a domino effect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584020"
msgid "How long has it been?\nWhat's happened to the world since I've been out?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584092"
msgid "But right now, none of that matters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584132"
msgid "\n\n        …and so, the battles came to an end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
