msgctxt "584508"
msgid "The #RUBSMoon Cell#RUBEdivine eye#REND changes the future\naccording to the #RUBS  wishes#RUBEdesires#REND of he who possesses it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584640"
msgid "And now that machine no longer exists.\nThe way the #C000246204Moon Cell Automaton#CDEF functions\nwas transformed into something else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584776"
msgid "…please, take comfort.\nThe observation device is reverting into\nwhat it once was: a dreaming machine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584880"
msgid "\n―――Thus, everything came to an end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584920"
msgid "Bless this fool.\n           #[He][She]# was annihilated as the final\n           victor of the Moon's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585056"
msgid "\n\n\n                       ――Sincerely, the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core -\n                                    #RUBS    Angelica Cage  #RUBECage of Heaven's #RENDdevoted#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585232"
msgid "\n#C080080080I squint under the strong sunlight.\nLooks like today's going to be another scorcher.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585336"
msgid "The smell of the earth. The far-off hustle and bustle.\nThe feel of the wind. The sound of a jeep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585436"
msgid "I can hear the trainees shouting off in the distance.\nThey must have them running a marathon to gauge their stamina."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585556"
msgid "I slip away to sit under the shade of a tree\nso I can skip… erm, take a break from training."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585652"
msgid "\nI know I'm really shifting gears here,\nbut my name is #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585740"
msgid "I only just woke up a while ago.\nI've come from thirty years in the past."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585816"
msgid "I was infected with a virus that broke out\nin the twentieth century.\nBasically, I was in a deep sleep\nuntil they could invent a cure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585952"
msgid "The name of the disease I had was \"Amnesia Syndrome\":\na condition where the memory portions of the\nbrain get overwritten."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586076"
msgid "Once you're infected, you start to lose your memory day by day."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586140"
msgid "Although they apparently found a cure, my memory is still hazy.\nI don't know if it's an after-effect\nor if I didn't get the cure in time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586280"
msgid "Yep. I kind of get the feeling that somewhere in the\ndepths of my mind, there's a me quipping \"not again!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586388"
msgid "But hey, I'm truly fortunate to be awake again.\nI'm grateful to be able to fill my lungs\nwith fresh air like this again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586512"
msgid "They say a disaster caused its social system to collapse.\nThe cities fell apart, and the people scattered across\nthe world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586636"
msgid "And that's how a certain island nation came to\ntake a long leave of absence.\nWest European countries then stepped up to become\nthe largest world powers, completely controlling\nall resources and putting the progression of human\ntechnology on hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586884"
msgid "After I underwent cryopreservation,\nthe two biggest countries of the world―\nwith their large populations and fondness for mass production―\nultimately fell together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587052"
msgid "The West European countries managed to domineer\n60 percent of Earth's resources in the blink of an eye.\nThey're pushing to establish a society\ncontrolled by a ruling class.\nNaturally, this system of government\nis run by Caucasians."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587284"
msgid "On the other hand, although countries of the\nMiddle East can't manage to unify,\nthey oppose the ideologies of West Europe.\nThey continue to skirmish against them over\nall corners of the world even now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587488"
msgid "In the midst of all this,\nI awoke in the ruins of my home country.\nAfter undertaking an adventure beyond words,\nI left my island nation and went overseas.\nI was pursued by a West European conglomerate\n(for some reason, I was on their wanted list!)\nbut escaped. Now, I'm under care in a\nrefugee camp in the Middle East."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587808"
msgid "Even if you're not a mercenary or a soldier,\nin this day and age there's a minimum level of skills\nyou need to have if you want to survive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587948"
msgid "That's why I joined an organization that\nvolunteers by giving these kinds of lectures\nand took some training from them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588068"
msgid "I was just a high school student from an age of peace.\nAfter surviving this long, I think I deserve a little applause."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588188"
msgid "I woke up to find the family always by my side,\nthe friends I was close to―all gone.\nMy town is unrecognizable; nothing but sprawling ruins."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588332"
msgid "Also, it seems like I was the only person\nwho woke up from their cold sleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588412"
msgid "People dear to me entrusted me with the future.\nThe pride of those nameless people who never made it\nto the future is at stake.\nSo I don't want to just give up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588576"
msgid "That singular purpose drove me this far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588620"
msgid "…but, I really wish the universe would start going easy on me.\nAbandoning one's past self to embrace a new era is hard.\nPlain and simple."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588760"
msgid "All these thoughts popped into my head\nduring my 10 kilometer marathon.\nMy legs started giving out, so I went for some\ncool shade and ended up sitting down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588920"
msgid "The sunlight is strong today.\nI put my towel over my head, look down, and take a deep breath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589016"
msgid "My motto up until now was \"at least don't complain.\"\nBut I think I've straight up run out of gas."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589116"
msgid "You looking at me, God?\nAs you can see, this is as far as I can go on my own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589196"
msgid "I guess all of these pent up thoughts\ngushed out of me because I had myself a sit-down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589284"
msgid "…I really am at the end of my rope.\nFor whatever reason, I murmur to myself that\nI may never stand up again―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589400"
msgid "What's the matter?\nToo long of a break will end up hindering you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589468"
msgid "\n\n―――I squint under the strong sunlight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589512"
msgid "The blue sky makes an impact on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589548"
msgid "Ahh, sorry.\nAs of today, I'm the appointed\ncombat instructor here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589616"
msgid "You're #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, right? I've been\nhired to look after you. I'm sure you have\nreservations, but please understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589752"
msgid "So, for the next half a year, there will be no\npretense between us. I work for my pay.\nThe rest depends on your effort and guts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589884"
msgid "…hey, you're dehydrated bad.\nCan you stand? I'll give you a hand\nif it's too hard to do on your own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589988"
msgid "―――I remember something from my long sleep.\nI had a dream about someone with the same name and soul as me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590100"
msgid "Okay. Then let me introduce myself again. Having\nyou call me \"instructor\" doesn't sit right with\nme, so from now on, call me by my name."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590240"
msgid "Pleasure to meet you, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nMy name is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590312"
msgid "\n#C080080080―――I grab his outstretched hand.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590368"
msgid "#C080080080―――I had collapsed from all my whining,\nbut new blood now flows through me.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590464"
msgid "#C080080080―――A sentiment from someone other than\n      myself flickers in me:\n      \"thanks for staying until the end.\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590596"
msgid "#C080080080…once, I had lost many things.\n         Many events had faded into the past.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590692"
msgid "#C080080080I don't know if any reward in this\nworld is worth the loss of so much.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590780"
msgid "#C080080080I, \"#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF#C080080080,\" anywhere or anytime,\nam nothing more than one, insignificant person.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590916"
msgid "#C080080080Here I am, alive and with a heart lit with joy.\nEven if I've lost my ability to fight,\nmy heart can summon it all back at any time.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591064"
msgid "#C080080080―――Go on. You've lost your fragmented dream.\n      From here on out, this won't be a dream;\n      it'll be the story of your future, reserved for you.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591236"
msgid "\n\n        …and so, the battles came to an end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591284"
msgid "Whoever it was that desired war across Earth is gone now.\nAnd just like him,\nit was all thanks to this nobody of a young #[man][woman]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591424"
msgid "\nWhat was awarded to the victor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591460"
msgid "Was that almighty wish-granting device, in truth,\ncapable of granting wishes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591540"
msgid "…the person who knows those answers, now,\nis silently crumbling away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591612"
msgid "The #RUBSMoon Cell#RUBEdivine eye#REND changes the future\naccording to the #RUBS  wishes#RUBEdesires#REND of he who possesses it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591744"
msgid "And now that device no longer exists.\nThe way the #C000246204Moon Cell Automaton#CDEF functions\nwas transformed into something else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591880"
msgid "…please, take comfort.\nThe observation device is reverting into\nwhat it once was: a dreaming machine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591984"
msgid "\n―――Thus, everything came to an end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592024"
msgid "Bless this fool.\n           #[He][She]# was annihilated as the final\n           victor of the Moon's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592160"
msgid "\n\n\n                       ――Sincerely, the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core -\n                                    #RUBS    Angelica Cage  #RUBECage of Heaven's #RENDdevoted#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592336"
msgid "――――Well.\nThat's what SHOULD'VE happened, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592392"
msgid "Yes, a time barrier is nothing to me!\nCall and I'll be there posthaste!\nNot that I was actually called here, though鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592512"
msgid "However! Though the world may accept your\nsacrifice to bring peace to the Earth,\nthe gods will not!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592612"
msgid "If I am stolen from, I steal back. If I receive\npushback, I push until I win. If it's against\nthe rules, then I change the rules―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592748"
msgid "That's the spirit of someone in love!\nThose who would impede me, beware!\nYou'll get a #RUBSSolar Flare Kick#RUBEFlare Skirt#REND to the face!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592892"
msgid "#C080080080…she's really done it this time.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592944"
msgid "#C080080080Her sunny smile could smooth over just about anything.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593016"
msgid "#C080080080And thus, with a single embrace,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF#C080080080's fate―which was supposed\nto have decidedly ended―fades into the seaweeds\nof the lunar ocean.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593204"
msgid "I open up and stuff my face with #C236196003Caster#CDEF's cooking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593272"
msgid "I silently nod in approval of the taste.\nEach time I do, #C236196003Caster#CDEF's ears perk up,\nand a broad smile washes over her face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593408"
msgid "It almost scares me how naturally I've adjusted to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593464"
msgid "But hey, I'm happy, so plenty of things don't bother me\nanymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593532"
msgid "Heehee. I made the right choice moving us here.\nAway from the clamor of the city,\nwe can spend our days in peace…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593648"
msgid "Not even light speed delivery reaches this back-\ncountry apartment at the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF's edge, but\nI'm happy. It's nice, despite being four-mat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593808"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF was fated to stop the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's\noperations and then be disassembled in the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593968"
msgid "But #C236196003Caster#CDEF stopped that from happening\nthrough her determination… or rather, her kick."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594072"
msgid "Specifically, I sort of Tamamo-kicked my\nway into that stubborn #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. After all,\nthe #RUBS  older sister#RUBESun#REND is never outshined by#RUBS    little brother#RUBE the Moon#REND鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594280"
msgid "#RUBS    Manifestation of a Woman's Power, Akin to a Solar Flare#RUBE          Flare Skirt Bunker Buster#REND\nis that spin kick's official name.\nIt dominates against underground structures…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594472"
msgid "I don't know if that was the best option,\nbut #C236196003Caster#CDEF busted her way into the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF\nby force and saved #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594652"
msgid "In the end, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF didn't completely stop functioning,\nbut the way it works changed.\nIt serves its new function best for humanity\nby being a new frontier for exploration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594848"
msgid "A new group of Masters arrived in the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF's center\nand are in the process of forming a new organization.\nThey're making substantial progress."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595012"
msgid "I have no way of returning to Earth,\nso this imaginary Spiritron world is my new home.\nMy main focus right now is on living here in peace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595152"
msgid "Gosh. You never want anything. We're in a great\nposition to seize political power. Wealth,\nriches, and influence as we want―and still."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595288"
msgid "But I love that unselfish side of you鷙 Okay,\nsay \"ahh\"鷙 My Tamamo pickles're more important\nthan any of that stuff, aren't they～!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595424"
msgid "…well, to be honest, I would turn into a real\nwitch if I had those three things. My feeling\nis, let those little humans have them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595556"
msgid "I always end up being the ruinous beauty in any\ncountry I'm in. I just need to be devoted to\nsomething. Being with you makes me happy鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595692"
msgid "Technically, I'm not even supposed to be alive right now.\nBut she protected me, cared for me,\nand even made an enemy out of #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF to save me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595856"
msgid "\n…I didn't find out what my wish was until the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595916"
msgid "After many battles, it seems I finally found out what it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595980"
msgid "Everything I desire lies spread across the future.\n    Now, nothing is missing from this dream―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596084"
msgid "―――It's time for the news. Early this\nmorning, yet again the mysterious hex-garbed\ngroup―\"Nine\"―has begun wreaking havoc."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596212"
msgid "The hex-garb group insist they \"will protect\nDarling,\" and will continue until \"they find\nthe traitor and bring her to her knees\"―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596348"
msgid "We have additional breaking news:\na notice from the new government."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596416"
msgid "Oh, my. What could that be? These organizations\nhave taken quite the disturbing turn.\nAnyway, Darling, here―say \"ahh\"鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596540"
msgid "Hey, #C236196003Caster#CDEF! We should be panicking!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596596"
msgid "We have a new report:\na statement has arrived from the group\nbelieved to be the criminals responsible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596700"
msgid "\"This is to the traitor #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\n This world belongs to me now. If you wish to do\n something about it, then come to my castle.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596852"
msgid "\"Do so quickly. There will be no delays. If you\n don't come, this world is going to look like\n an RPG Maker game of national renown!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596988"
msgid "…hold up.\nLet's just say that the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is in trouble\nand leave it at that for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597096"
msgid "I feel dizzy. I'm about to faint.\nI have no clue what's going on,\nbut there's one thing I can be sure about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597208"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF is, without a doubt, the culprit here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597272"
msgid "Ahh, they're even stealing our resources―――\nAll Masters, please remain orderly and―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597360"
msgid "Each nation has its own principles, fetishes,\nflaws, and advantages―but you lowly citizens\nhave no choice in the matter!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597484"
msgid "We hereby declare that every day shall be\na comical play, completely directed under\nour control!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597584"
msgid "As for you, traitor; the original! Your just\ndeserts are on their way! Ah, prepare\nyourself too, Darling. You're complicit鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597712"
msgid "――――――. (Mind is blank.)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597744"
msgid "Ohh, nooo, Darling! #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF is sooo scared鷙\nI just have NO clue what I did, so why am\nI getting aaaalllll this resentment?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597884"
msgid "…I reel back my swooning consciousness\nand grab the root of all evil by her shoulders."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "597972"
msgid "What did you do, you dumb fox!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598004"
msgid "…honestly, umm.\nSo in order to bring you back here,\nI needed to enter my nine-tailed state, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598104"
msgid "I leveled up a bunch, sped through strict sage\ntraining then went into my nine-tailed form.\nThanks to that, I conquered the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598256"
msgid "So that's what I did, but…\nthat's when I realized that there was a problem.\n\"What should I do with all these tails?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598376"
msgid "However, it was too late. Once I reunited\nwith Darling, my various tails began\nlaying claims to \"what was theirs by right.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598500"
msgid "I quietly severed each tail and threw them\ninto the Imaginary Number Space. Perhaps I\nshouldn't have done that, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598620"
msgid "Now they've returned as bosses.\nThat's who those girls are―――They are known\nas the \"Alter Ego Tamamo Nine\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598732"
msgid "Kya☆\nPleaaaasee don't get so mad at me鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598776"
msgid "D'oh. They grew up so fast―they even took over\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF…! But they're my tails\nafter all, so they're positively insatiable!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598924"
msgid "…not much we can do about the past.\nWe're going to have to get out there\nand quell this uprising ourselves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599036"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF turned into the nine-tails she loathes\nso much in order to save #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599156"
msgid "! Darling, you've got a Master's glint\nin your eyes! Could it be!?\nYou'll fight together with me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599256"
msgid "…I know I shouldn't be indulging her…\nbut I just can't say no to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599328"
msgid "Thus, together with #C236196003Caster#CDEF―the source of\nall these evils―we embarked towards a new\nbattle to subdue the Tamamo Nine―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599468"
msgid "Next time in episode one: the fearsome\nbrand-fanatic, Tamamo Gucci, takes the stage!\nDon't miss―ouch!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599572"
msgid "You're the source of all the evils.\nPlease reflect on your actions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599640"
msgid "To be honest, I'm feeling a bit excited myself.\nI get to fight alongside her again.\nAnd this time, we're going worldwide. Nine countries.\nHow could this NOT get my heart pumping?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599820"
msgid "\nWe spent a brief, peaceful time here in this\napartment as #C236196003Caster#CDEF had wished to.\nNow we're taking our leave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599948"
msgid "Alright. Time to get this headache of a journey started.\nWe're up against eight #C236196003Casters#CDEF.\nI'm looking forward to seeing what aspects of hers\nI'll get to witness through them―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600144"
msgid "…! Yes, leave it to me #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND!\nI have yet to prove myself worthy,\nbut I'll follow you to the ends of the Earth!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600284"
msgid "\n\n        …and so, the battles came to an end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600332"
msgid "Whoever it was that desired war across Earth is gone now.\nAnd just like him,\nit was all thanks to this nobody of a young #[man][woman]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600472"
msgid "\nWhat was awarded to the victor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600508"
msgid "Was that almighty wish-granting device, in truth,\ncapable of granting wishes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600588"
msgid "…the person who knows those answers, now,\nis silently crumbling away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600660"
msgid "The #RUBSMoon Cell#RUBEdivine eye#REND changes the future\naccording to the #RUBS  wishes#RUBEdesires#REND of he who possesses it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600792"
msgid "And now that device no longer exists.\nThe way the #C000246204Moon Cell Automaton#CDEF functions\nwas transformed into something else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600928"
msgid "…please, take comfort.\nThe observation device is reverting into\nwhat it once was: a dreaming machine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601032"
msgid "―――And thus, it all came to an end―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601076"
msgid "No, that won't be happening. Never have I seen\nso vacuous an entity as the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. Who would\nstand to see an undisputed victor vanquished?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601236"
msgid "If you have no need for this #[man][girl]#,\nthen I shall have #[him][her]# for myself!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601324"
msgid "\n\n        #C080080080The light blazes so bright, as if piercing my eyelids.\n        I hear a deafening sound, like the cacophony\n        of a million people passing by.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601500"
msgid "So, you finally made it. I figured I would try\nthis \"jump drive\" since it's instantaneous,\nbut it's quite a puzzling contraption."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601632"
msgid "Well, no matter. I received what I requested.\nAwaken, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nHow long do you plan on dozing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601744"
msgid "#C080080080There, I see―――#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601780"
msgid "Before my now opened eyes lies, without exaggeration,\nan entirely different world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601864"
msgid "I'm near the spire of some massive tower of a monument.\nI'm standing about 600 meters high in the air."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601968"
msgid "A gala of light pulses far and wide below.\nI first thought that it was a resplendent ocean,\nbut it's actually locomoting light."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602096"
msgid "It's a golden city that stretches on without end;\na bypass where Spiritrons flow to and fro through the air."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602208"
msgid "Ahh, this is a port.\nI got the initial sense that this was some kind of airport.\nThen maybe that means this a control tower."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602336"
msgid "I'm overlooking an unknown world overflowing with light―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602400"
msgid "Hmph. How dull. Would it kill you to be a little\nsurprised? I was hoping you would be shaken from\nawe, lose your footing, then take a tumble…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602544"
msgid "And over here is my ghastly Servant that I'm oh-so fond of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602604"
msgid "Let me just state that I'm not at all composed right now.\nI'm simply so overcome with wonder that I can't process this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602724"
msgid "I made it to the end of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602784"
msgid "I got into the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF, resolved that entire fiasco,\nand was subsequently rewarded by being disassembled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602916"
msgid "I woke up to find myself in an unmistakably sci-fi world.\nI'd like an ego massage after not even fainting after all that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603040"
msgid "Where? This is an imaginary Spiritron\nworld apart from the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF ; the Spiritron\nnetwork of a different celestial body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603180"
msgid "Seeking any planet with intelligent life that\nconsumes and develops, I warped us here to rid\nourselves of our #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF problem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603328"
msgid "Well―――I say we're about 1,500 light years\nfrom Earth, but just bear with it. What does it\nmatter anyway, with so grand a spectacle!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603464"
msgid "\"Hahahahaha,\" the #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF gleefully laughs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603532"
msgid "Err… a \"different celestial body\"?\nWe super warped here?\n1,500 light years away? Don't tell me we're in Orion?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603644"
msgid "No, that's a bit farther, I think.\nLo, gaze up at the sky. Doesn't that nebula\nremind you of a horse's head?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603756"
msgid "I don't even―――Does the King of Heroes\neven FATHOM what he's done!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603828"
msgid "Well… he certainly has a point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603864"
msgid "At the time, I had resigned myself to my fate.\nDeep down though, I didn't want to disappear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603960"
msgid "Greed should be let to expand as it needs.\nI, at least, wasn't pleased with\nabiding by such an outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604064"
msgid "Also, you know.\nThere's one thing that you lack.\nI figured I would teach it to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604148"
msgid "I lack something…?\nNot my inexperience or ineptitude―I lack something else…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604228"
msgid "You don't know? It's the delight of learning new\nthings; fostering the instinct that sends one's\nheart aflutter from traversing the unknown."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604372"
msgid "It's the amusement that decorates the\nevents of one's life―――\nBasically, experiencing \"joy.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604468"
msgid "A world I've never seen before.\nA future I'm free to stroll through, challenge, race through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604564"
msgid "You were always proficient in being distressed,\nbut piddling when it came to enjoying things.\nThat's no way to be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604680"
msgid "But, now that we're in this world apart, you'll\nlearn whether you want to or not: of the joys of\nlife; the meaning of your existence even."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604820"
msgid "This is a novel world even to me, anyway.\nHow could one not feel exhilarated?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604900"
msgid "What say you, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF?\nHere, you'll be on humanity's forefront."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604988"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's lips curl into a smile,\nthen he holds out a hand to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605072"
msgid "His smile lacks compassion as always,\nbut it's brimming with a pioneer's delight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605156"
msgid "His outstretched hand isn't inviting me for a handshake;\nit's inviting me to explore alongside him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605256"
msgid "―――*sigh*. I swallow down the vexation rising\nfrom the bottom of my heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605336"
msgid "I bet I'll be objecting to this nonstop later,\nbut I can't find a single thing to complain about right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605444"
msgid "Reason being, as he said―this grand sight represents my future,\nand that takes precedence over all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605548"
msgid "Well said.\nNow, how about we plunge straight into\nour new journey?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605616"
msgid "We will conquer the oceans of this planet. One\nday humanity will know of them, but we'll have\nthe pleasure of knowing them first, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605756"
msgid "In this new world, even he's less than a grunt.\nHe has no fame here and is just level one.\nDespite that, I nod back to my arrogant partner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605896"
msgid "\n―――This is the final #RUBS  logged #RUBErecorded#REND scene."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605964"
msgid "The future continues racing onward.\nHumans continue expanding outward.\nWe aim to one day arrive at moment \"where it all ends.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606092"
msgid "…and so, I pray:\nmay my journey with this mighty king end before\nhis unrealistic expectations drain the life out me―――"
msgstr ""

